<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>About Us – Gameso | Play Free Online Games</title>

  <meta name="description" content="Learn more about Gameso, an online gaming platform where you can discover and play free browser games including puzzle, arcade, racing, action, and strategy games.">

  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">

  <link rel="canonical" href="https://gameso.vercel.app/about-us.html">

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f6f8fb;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-page {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 20px 80px;
    }

    .about-hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .about-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #6366f1;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about-hero p {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .about-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    .about-card h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .about-card p {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .about-full {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    .about-full h2 {
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .about-full p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .about-list {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding-left: 22px;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .about-list li {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .about-cta {
      text-align: center;
      background: #111827;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px 25px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .about-cta h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-cta p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    .about-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #6366f1;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .about-button:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {

      .about-page {
        padding: 40px 16px 60px;
      }

      .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .about-hero p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-card,
      .about-full {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .about-card h2,
      .about-full h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .about-cta h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="about-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <span class="about-label">About Gameso</span>

      <h1>About Gameso – Play Free Online Games</h1>

      <p>
        Welcome to Gameso, a simple and growing online gaming platform where
        you can discover and play fun, engaging games directly in your browser.
      </p>
    </section>


    <!-- Main Cards -->
    <section class="about-grid">

      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>What Is Gameso?</h2>

        <p>
          Gameso is an online gaming platform featuring a growing collection
          of browser games across different categories. Players can discover
          games such as 2048, Minesweeper, Snake, Tic Tac Toe, Memory Game,
          Traffic Racer, Flappy Bird, Pong, Breakout, and more.
        </p>
      </article>


      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Our Goal</h2>

        <p>
          Our goal is to provide a simple and enjoyable gaming experience for
          visitors of different skill levels. We focus on easy navigation,
          straightforward game instructions, and a variety of games so players
          can quickly find something they enjoy.
        </p>
      </article>


      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Play Games Online</h2>

        <p>
          Gameso allows visitors to discover and play games directly through
          their web browser. Our game pages provide useful information such as
          how to play, controls, rules, and helpful tips where appropriate.
        </p>
      </article>


      <article class="about-card">
        <h2>Built for Easy Access</h2>

        <p>
          We aim to make Gameso easy to use on both desktop and mobile devices.
          Whether you want to enjoy a quick puzzle or spend more time playing
          an arcade, racing, action, or strategy game, you can explore games
          in one convenient place.
        </p>
      </article>

    </section>


    <!-- Explore Games -->
    <section class="about-full">

      <h2>Explore Games on Gameso</h2>

      <p>
        Gameso includes different types of online games for players with
        different interests. You can explore puzzle games, arcade games,
        racing games, action games, strategy games, brain games, and other
        browser-based experiences.
      </p>

      <p>
        Each game is designed to be easy to discover and access. We continue
        working on the website to improve navigation, add useful information,
        and introduce more games over time.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Why Gameso -->
    <section class="about-full">

      <h2>Why Visit Gameso?</h2>

      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>A growing collection of free online games</li>
        <li>Multiple game categories</li>
        <li>Simple and easy-to-use interface</li>
        <li>Browser-based gaming without complicated installation</li>
        <li>Game instructions and helpful information</li>
        <li>Designed for desktop and mobile users</li>
        <li>Easy navigation for discovering new games</li>
      </ul>

    </section>


    <!-- Content -->
    <section class="about-full">

      <h2>Our Content & Games</h2>

      <p>
        We aim to provide useful and original information around the games
        available on Gameso. Game descriptions, instructions, controls, and
        tips are created to help visitors understand each game and enjoy it
        more easily.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you notice a technical problem, incorrect information, or have
        feedback about a game or the website, you can contact us through our
        Contact Us page.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="about-cta">

      <h2>Keep Exploring Gameso</h2>

      <p>
        Discover new games, explore different categories, and find something
        fun to play directly in your browser.
      </p>

      <a href="/" class="about-button">
        Explore Games
      </a>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
